  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre Duramix is a hybrid multifilament string combining 50% polyamide fibres for comfort and feel with 50% polyester fibres for firmer response, increased control and improved durability. High Density Polyurethane (HD PU) provides a firmer and more controlled feel than traditional soft multifilaments, while SPL surface treatment improves string movement and snap-back. Available in Natural and Black and in 1.25, 1.30 and 1.35 mm gauges, Duramix is particularly suitable for skilled players seeking comfort with greater firmness and durability.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre Duramix 是一款混合多芯球线，由50%聚酰胺纤维与50%聚酯纤维组成。聚酰胺负责提供舒适性和击球反馈，而聚酯则带来更扎实的手感、更强控制以及更好的耐久性。HD PU 高密度聚氨酯让整体手感比传统柔软型多芯线更加紧实，SPL 表面处理则帮助球线快速回位并提升 Snapback。提供 Natural 与 Black 两种颜色，以及1.25、1.30和1.35毫米三种线径，非常适合希望兼顾舒适、控制与耐久的中高级球员。"
  },

